<section class="onboarding-step welcome-step" data-step="0" <?= $step!==0?'hidden':'' ?>><div class="welcome-art"><span><?= icon('rocket',49) ?></span><i></i><i></i></div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER STARTS HERE</span><h1>Hey <?= e(firstName($currentUser['full_name'])) ?>,<br>let’s see where this takes you.</h1><p>A new skill, a bigger idea, a little more confidence. Let’s make a learning space that feels like you. This takes about two minutes.</p><div class="onboarding-small-path" style="justify-content:center;max-width:390px;margin:25px auto"><?= icon('sparkles',20) ?> No perfect plan needed. Just a starting point.</div></section>
<section class="onboarding-step" data-step="1" <?= $step!==1?'hidden':'' ?>><span class="eyebrow">FOLLOW THAT LITTLE SPARK</span><h1>What are you curious about?</h1><p>Choose one or more skills you’d like to explore. You can always change your mind later.</p><?php if(!$categories): ?><div class="notice info"><p>Skill categories are being prepared. You can finish setup now and choose your interests later.</p></div><?php endif; ?><div class="choice-grid"><?php foreach($categories as $c): ?><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="interests[]" value="<?= (int)$c['id'] ?>" <?= in_array($c['id'],$selected)?'checked':'' ?>><span class="choice-content"><span class="icon-tile <?= e($c['color']) ?>"><?= icon($c['icon'],22) ?></span><div><strong><?= e($c['name']) ?></strong></div><i class="choice-marker"></i></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
<section class="onboarding-step" data-step="2" <?= $step!==2?'hidden':'' ?>><span class="eyebrow">LET’S FIND YOUR WHY</span><h1>What brings you here?</h1><p>There’s no wrong reason to learn something new. What feels closest to your goal?</p><div class="choice-stack"><?php foreach(['new_skill'=>['Learn a new skill','A little curiosity can go a long way.','lightbulb'],'projects'=>['Build personal projects','Bring that idea to life.','code'],'career'=>['Prepare for a career','Make room for new possibilities.','briefcase'],'improve'=>['Improve existing skills','Take what you know a little further.','chart'],'freelancing'=>['Start freelancing','Build skills you can put to work.','rocket']] as $value=>[$label,$desc,$icon]): ?><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="goal" value="<?= $value ?>" <?= $goal===$value?'checked':'' ?>><span class="choice-content"><span class="icon-tile orange"><?= icon($icon,20) ?></span><div><strong><?= $label ?></strong><small><?= $desc ?></small></div><i class="choice-marker"></i></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
<section class="onboarding-step" data-step="3" <?= $step!==3?'hidden':'' ?>><span class="eyebrow">EVERY STARTING POINT IS A GOOD ONE</span><h1>Where are you starting from?</h1><p>This helps us point you towards a comfortable next step. No test. No pressure.</p><div class="choice-stack"><?php foreach(['beginner'=>['Complete beginner','I’m ready for my first little breakthrough.','lightbulb'],'some'=>['Some experience','I’ve explored a little and want a clearer path.','book'],'intermediate'=>['Intermediate','I know the basics and want to build on them.','rocket']] as $value=>[$label,$desc,$icon]): ?><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="experience" value="<?= $value ?>" <?= $experience===$value?'checked':'' ?>><span class="choice-content"><span class="icon-tile purple"><?= icon($icon,21) ?></span><div><strong><?= $label ?></strong><small><?= $desc ?></small></div><i class="choice-marker"></i></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></section>
<section class="onboarding-step" data-step="4" <?= $step!==4?'hidden':'' ?>><span class="eyebrow">SMALL HABITS. BIG POSSIBILITIES.</span><h1>A little time for your future.</h1><p>Choose a daily learning target that fits your life. A manageable goal is a goal you can come back to.</p><div class="goal-choices"><?php foreach([10=>'A little spark',15=>'A steady rhythm',30=>'Room to explore',60=>'A deeper dive'] as $minutes=>$label): ?><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="daily_minutes" value="<?= $minutes ?>" <?= $daily===$minutes?'checked':'' ?>><span class="choice-content"><strong><?= $minutes ?></strong><small>minutes a day</small><span class="goal-caption"><?= $label ?></span><i class="choice-marker"></i></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></div><p class="goal-recommendation"><?= icon('lightbulb',17) ?> 15 minutes is a comfortable place to start.</p><div class="notice info" style="margin-top:25px"><?= icon('info',18) ?><p>Your goal uses credits from completed activities and estimated lesson durations. It does not measure how long your browser stays open.</p></div></section>
<section class="onboarding-step" data-step="5" <?= $step!==5?'hidden':'' ?>><span class="eyebrow">MAKE A LITTLE SPACE TO GROW</span><h1>Find a rhythm that fits.</h1><p>Pick the days you’d like to learn. Reminders are optional, and rest days are welcome.</p><span class="field-label">Your study days</span><div class="schedule-week"><?php foreach(['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat','Sun'] as $i=>$day): ?><label class="day-choice"><input type="checkbox" name="study_days[]" value="<?= $i+1 ?>" <?= in_array($i+1,$days)?'checked':'' ?>><span><strong><?= $day[0] ?></strong><?= $day ?></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="reminder-time">A good time to learn</label><input id="reminder-time" type="time" name="reminder_time" value="<?= e($saved['reminder_time']??'18:00') ?>"></div><div class="field"><label for="timezone">Your timezone</label><select id="timezone" name="timezone"><?php foreach(DateTimeZone::listIdentifiers() as $tz): ?><option value="<?= e($tz) ?>" <?= $tz===$timezone?'selected':'' ?>><?= e(str_replace('_',' ',$tz)) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div></div><label class="switch-row" style="margin-top:19px"><div><strong style="font-size:12px;font-weight:500">A friendly nudge</strong><p>Enable in-app study reminders for your schedule.</p></div><input class="switch" type="checkbox" name="reminders_enabled" value="1" aria-label="Enable study reminders" <?= !empty($saved['reminders_enabled'])?'checked':'' ?>></label><p class="fine-print" style="margin-top:13px">Email reminders work only when email delivery is configured and you opt in. Your timezone also determines your streak days.</p></section>
<section class="onboarding-step" data-step="6" <?= $step!==6?'hidden':'' ?>><span class="eyebrow">YOUR CURIOSITY, WITH A LITTLE DIRECTION</span><h1>Meet your next chapter.</h1><p>Choose a published path to start with. Recommendations use your selected interests—not AI or assumptions about you.</p><div class="choice-stack"><?php foreach($paths as $p): ?><label class="choice path-choice" data-path-category="<?= (int)$p['category_id'] ?>"><input type="radio" name="path_id" value="<?= (int)$p['id'] ?>" <?= (int)($saved['path_id']??0)===(int)$p['id']?'checked':'' ?>><span class="choice-content"><span class="icon-tile <?= e($p['color']) ?>"><?= icon($p['icon'],22) ?></span><div><span class="recommendation-label" hidden>A MATCH FOR YOUR INTERESTS</span><strong><?= e($p['title']) ?></strong><p><?= e($p['description']) ?></p><small><?= (int)$p['lesson_count'] ?> lessons · <?= e(ucfirst($p['difficulty'])) ?></small></div><i class="choice-marker"></i></span></label><?php endforeach; ?><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="path_id" value="0" <?= empty($saved['path_id'])?'checked':'' ?>><span class="choice-content"><span class="icon-tile blue"><?= icon('search',20) ?></span><div><strong>I’ll explore a little first.</strong><small>You can enrol whenever you’re ready.</small></div><i class="choice-marker"></i></span></label></div></section>
<section class="onboarding-step welcome-step" data-step="7" <?= $step!==7?'hidden':'' ?>><div class="welcome-art"><span><?= icon('sparkles',49) ?></span><i></i><i></i></div><span class="eyebrow">THIS IS THE START OF SOMETHING GOOD</span><h1>Your future has<br>a little more possibility.</h1><p>Your learning space is ready, <?= e(firstName($currentUser['full_name'])) ?>. A clear next step, a manageable goal and room to make it your own.</p><div class="welcome-summary"><div><?= icon('target',19) ?><span data-summary-goal></span></div><div><?= icon('calendar',19) ?><span data-summary-days></span></div><div><?= icon('shield',19) ?><span>Your progress starts at zero. Every win will be yours.</span></div></div></section>
